<title>FINLAND: NOVA 1996 PREMIUM INCOME FIM 948 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVA 1996 PREMIUM INCOME FIM 948 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Premium income				   947.6 vs 2,823.4</p>
<p> Balance on technical account		  64.8 vs 124.0</p>
<p> Claims paid (total)			    866.1 vs 1,417.2</p>
<p> Investment income				884.1 vs 775.9</p>
<p> Investment expenses			    392.5 vs 213.2</p>
<p> Operating costs				   54.0 vs 42.9</p>
<p> Net result					  36.9 vs 78.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Nova said its premium income in 1995 excluding the</p>
<p>exceptional transfer of the portfolio of the savings banks'</p>
<p>pension fund was 547 million markka.</p>
<p>Full name of Finnish life insurance company is</p>
<p>Henkivakuutusyhtio Nova.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
